{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":656908,\"title\":\"Ramayana: Rise of a Legend\",\"tagline\":\"Our truth. Our history\",\"overview\":\"An ancient epic follows a young prince and princess whose marriage and subsequent exile mark the beginning of a legendary journey. Their story of love, duty and destiny sets the stage for greater challenges ahead.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vBQ7wks68OhJKlb3RnXSl2yXBXK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yHVZncPRZr63mezRX20IyKLrSkv.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"voteCount\":72,\"year\":2026,\"runtime\":195,\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IN\",\"name\":\"India\"},{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":260000000,\"revenue\":147803121,\"director\":\"Nitesh Tiwari\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1042010,\"name\":\"Nitesh Tiwari\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h80yPI8rDKlUk29dWFFl6Is8J0P.jpg\"},{\"id\":85034,\"name\":\"Ranbir Kapoor\",\"character\":\"Prince Rama / Parashurama\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ymYNHV9luwgyrw17NXHqbOWTQkg.jpg\"},{\"id\":1293681,\"name\":\"Yash\",\"character\":\"Dashanan 'Ravana'\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/es8St0vl9otL1XAAZJKYmNpL3Wy.jpg\"},{\"id\":1473119,\"name\":\"Sai Pallavi\",\"character\":\"Sita\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qAPdGKUIUEzLibdgVCey7oKvvME.jpg\"},{\"id\":1252841,\"name\":\"Ravi Dubey\",\"character\":\"Lakshmana\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dUhZ0E8nchBkjYV0okWfj4BLxy2.jpg\"},{\"id\":1228593,\"name\":\"Arun Govil\",\"character\":\"King Dashrath\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xgefRNWurCiwyLSlpnDGgfMIF7H.jpg\"},{\"id\":110298,\"name\":\"Shobana\",\"character\":\"Kaikesi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t6niRFC3xCV6hJSuyC9ACWLSVXu.jpg\"},{\"id\":55063,\"name\":\"Lara Dutta\",\"character\":\"Kaikeyi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tt0qUlMx7tlDa8XyhBm6OQPurG0.jpg\"},{\"id\":1143308,\"name\":\"Rakul Preet Singh\",\"character\":\"Surpanakha\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4n4MmOFNyxKc4qMfzyapglvDDlF.jpg\"},{\"id\":85668,\"name\":\"Vivek Oberoi\",\"character\":\"Vidyutjihva\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/60T3Q8CsxF4kF6RIHZ1yis2Q0wA.jpg\"},{\"id\":1682080,\"name\":\"Adinath Kothare\",\"character\":\"Bharata\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mqvDNAFiy2kkFZZUJCyIgM46nm1.jpg\"},{\"id\":1255589,\"name\":\"Indira Krishnan\",\"character\":\"Kaushalya\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fbN5eUSX9UjizTfotFh8Ka6NyqV.jpg\"},{\"id\":1246534,\"name\":\"Sonal Jha\",\"character\":\"Sumitra\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/buTWA0SHsB9ZQwBrgSxotNle0Rf.jpg\"},{\"id\":5567248,\"name\":\"Nitish Sharma\",\"character\":\"Shatrughna\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rOJuahpVwaRt3caFjC5jGUC0M5S.jpg\"},{\"id\":113809,\"name\":\"Kajal Aggarwal\",\"character\":\"Mandodari\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wDzYjnDRNzyigCPBEwc9gf1hZ0Q.jpg\"},{\"id\":6217,\"name\":\"Anupam Kher\",\"character\":\"Jatayu (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kgU5Ap1Kf9RnicB5DMcXEZqed2f.jpg\"}],\"franchise\":{\"name\":\"World of Ramayana\",\"parts\":[{\"id\":656908,\"title\":\"Ramayana: Rise of a Legend\",\"year\":2026,\"rating\":7.4},{\"id\":1383500,\"title\":\"Ramayana: Part Two\",\"year\":2028,\"rating\":0}]},\"similar\":[{\"id\":1368337,\"title\":\"The Odyssey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5rhTDKUhPYvpdQIijFIs5VoWsON.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c7btGYblBnfAaw713WvFM0Kimc7.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Odysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980431,\"title\":\"Avatar Aang: The Last Airbender\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3sgnSfNT27Bx5O5ukr7B26mhEQq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezbrL1dMymKQZw7mDEWa2ZTzN7d.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Avatar Aang, the world's last Airbender, learns of an ancient power that could save his culture from extinction. With the help of his friends, he embarks on a global quest to find it before it falls into the wrong hands and threatens to upend the peace they sacrificed everything to achieve.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":120,\"title\":\"The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6oom5QYQ2yQTMJIbnvbkBL9cHo6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oiwc338EoBgS4sEI2ixAny4KQKg.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Young hobbit Frodo Baggins, after inheriting a mysterious ring from his uncle Bilbo, must leave his home in order to keep it from falling into the hands of its evil creator. Along the way, a fellowship is formed to protect the ringbearer and make sure that the ring arrives at its final destination: Mt. Doom, the only place where it can be destroyed.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":453395,\"title\":\"Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ddJcSKbcp4rKZTmuyWaMhuwcfMz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AdyJH8kDm8xT8IKTlgpEC15ny4u.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Doctor Strange, with the help of mystical allies both old and new, traverses the mind-bending and dangerous alternate realities of the Multiverse to confront a mysterious new adversary.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":122917,\"title\":\"The Hobbit: The Battle of the Five Armies\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xT98tLqatZPQApyRmlPL12LtiWp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3UbaCMmqOd7mca4Y5DOzY2ZVTyX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following Smaug's attack on Laketown, Bilbo and the dwarves try to defend Erebor's mountain of treasure from others who claim it: the men of the ruined Laketown and the elves of Mirkwood. Meanwhile an army of Orcs led by Azog the Defiler is marching on Erebor, fueled by the rise of the dark lord Sauron. Dwarves, elves and men must unite, and the hope for Middle-Earth falls into Bilbo's hands.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":566525,\"title\":\"Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9f2Q0U3IOsLgrI2HkvldwSABZy5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r7K6Xt0RX4Mw0cAbZVw5cyb1Tux.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Shang-Chi must confront the past he thought he left behind when he is drawn into the web of the mysterious Ten Rings organization.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22,\"title\":\"Pirates of the Caribbean: The Curse of the Black Pearl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/poHwCZeWzJCShH7tOjg8RIoyjcw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uRNgkJSkNBFbbn9fPsEjDIy8Sh3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When wily pirate Captain Barbossa seizes Jack Sparrow’s beloved ship, the Black Pearl, and kidnaps the governor’s daughter, Elizabeth Swann, blacksmith Will Turner reluctantly teams up with the unpredictable pirate Jack to rescue her—only to uncover a terrifying curse that turns Barbossa’s crew into the undead.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980477,\"title\":\"Ne Zha 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fcs5AdCKliQaQgXsPS9kDejamIJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gd9kxeEEONj5SECs4GA8Ddn3czI.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a catastrophic event leaves their bodies destroyed, Ne Zha and Ao Bing are granted a fragile second chance at life. As tensions rise between the dragon clans and celestial forces, the two must undergo a series of perilous trials that will test their bond, challenge their identities, and decide the fate of both mortals and immortals.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5353,\"title\":\"The Hunting Party\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kXUfQGa7BoW856hDYAFtZLtiAAQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k1dXZF6vyVgtmppyXWLZd9FmqmY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young journalist, an experienced cameraman and a discredited reporter find their bold plan to capture Bosnia's top war criminal quickly spiraling out of control when a UN representative mistakes them for a CIA hit squad.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":456711,\"title\":\"Yalghaar\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u4MH2dqitQlQGQQYdsGm7JkgFCn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pogogqsBREBIQBoDhrnHJRqJS7O.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on a true story, over 76 hours of a successful military operation conducted in the Piochar region of Swat district, Yalghaar goes up close to follow the lives of the young, passionate officers and soldiers whose patriotism is throbbing with every heartbeat for their country (Pakistan).\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5471,\"title\":\"Beowulf & Grendel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/49s4KMmF2YBJhHYTqwdvikpTztt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jSaZ02GsGuFIGo0B2kh3FA7hQ0Y.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The blood-soaked tale of a Norse warrior's battle against the great and murderous troll, Grendel. Heads will roll. Out of allegiance to the King Hrothgar, the much respected Lord of the Danes, Beowulf leads a troop of warriors across the sea to rid a village of the marauding monster.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2486,\"title\":\"Eragon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mNu6QLUnKqPIjRA3pgEb5dkJye6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2GB3sdsWn3drlkwGMMNQ3KFNbIV.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In his homeland of Alagaesia, a farm boy happens upon a dragon's egg -- a discovery that leads him on a predestined journey where he realized he's the one person who can defend his home against an evil king.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"AYkPRN874m8\",\"name\":\"New Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"74nF-FWAS6M\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer (English)\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"bw6NMTNS1ao\",\"name\":\"The numbers are in. Ramayana has exceeded $100M in global box office!\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}